Cell["\<\
The one-argument form does no normalization, so two inert words that are \
rotations of one another are different expressions:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e5800100-866c-4473-afc9-7c219220c718"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"CyclicWord", "[", 
